            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Dilo 1.2.0</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Macbrow integration:</strong> Macbrow's notch drawer can now show whether Dilo is recording, plus your recent meetings and voice notes. Connect it in Macbrow &gt; Settings &gt; Integrations.</li>
  <li>New <code>dilo://nota/&lt;id&gt;</code> link that opens a voice note directly.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
